{"turn_id": "d17-t2", "session_id": "d17", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "test_set_size", "text": "论文在无长度约束章节的所有实验都在完整的 English-German WMT news-test2015 测试集上进行，规模为 2,169 句。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}]}, {"key": "test_set_in_abstract", "text": "摘要称使用精确搜索为整个 WMT15 English-German 测试集找到 Transformer base 模型的全局最佳模型分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-e75fba389a988f777decdfb0"}]}, {"key": "model_and_training", "text": "该测试集实验使用 Transformer base 模型，通过 Tensor2Tensor 在排除 ParaCrawl 的平行 WMT18 数据上训练。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d17-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d17-t3", "session_id": "d17", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "1908_test_set_size", "text": "论文1908.10090的实验在完整的英文-德文WMT news-test2015测试集上进行，该测试集包含2,169个句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}, {"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-e75fba389a988f777decdfb0"}]}, {"key": "1908_training_data", "text": "论文1908.10090使用Tensor2Tensor在平行WMT18数据（排除ParaCrawl）上训练的Transformer base模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}]}, {"key": "1908_preprocessing", "text": "论文1908.10090的预处理采用了联合子词切分（byte pair encoding，32K merges）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}]}, {"key": "1910_test_set_role", "text": "论文1910.03355的语料库中，El Conde Lucanor由于语料规模小，仅用作测试集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "1910_test_set_size", "text": "论文1910.03355所用证据未给出任何测试集的具体句子或词元数量，仅说明El Conde Lucanor仅用作测试。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "1910_training_data", "text": "论文1910.03355的实验语料包括荷兰圣经（使用1637年版作为原文、1888年版作为现代荷兰语）和El Quijote（17世纪西班牙语原文与其21世纪版本）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "1910_training_data_el_conde", "text": "论文1910.03355因无法找到合适的训练语料，用为El Quijote构建的系统来现代化El Conde Lucanor（尽管原文属于不同时期）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "1910_training_corpus_small", "text": "论文1910.03355指出SMT在各案例中结果最好，这很可能归因于训练语料规模小——这是NMT的一个已知问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"}]}, {"key": "1910_models", "text": "论文1910.03355比较了SMT与NMT两种现代化方法，并将二者与交互式机器翻译协议结合。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"}, {"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-12faba6617d3bb70ca950aa7"}]}, {"key": "comparability", "text": "两篇论文不具直接可比性：1908.10090在WMT15英德测试集（2,169句）上分析NMT搜索误差与模型误差，而1910.03355证据未提供测试集规模，且其训练数据为历史文献现代化语料（荷兰圣经、El Quijote等），任务、语言对与数据领域均不同。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.10090", "chunk_id": "c-c4953b9c4ea7ec3abed8a6e0"}, {"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d17-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
